Package: peruocc
Title: Standardized Biodiversity Occurrence Queries across Administrative Units of Peru
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Paul Efren", "Santos Andrade",
    email = "paulfrenes@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
  )
Description: Facilitates the retrieval, spatial validation, and integration of
    flora and fauna occurrence records across administrative scales (districts
    and provinces) in Peru. Retrieves official boundary geometries via
    'geoperu', queries and consolidates observations from GBIF (Global
    Biodiversity Information Facility) and iNaturalist, and standardizes Darwin
    Core attributes into a unified object for biodiversity assessment within
    user-defined areas of interest.
